<title>CHINA: China hikes diesel price to 1,990 yuan a tonne.</title>
<headline>China hikes diesel price to 1,990 yuan a tonne.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>China raised the ex-refinery price for diesel to 1,990 yuan per tonne from 1,900 yuan effective from Friday, an official of state refiner SINOPEC said.  </p>
<p>&quot;We have already issued a document,&quot; the official of China National Petro-Chemical Corporation (SINOPEC) said by telephone.</p>
<p>&quot;The price change takes effect today and is an increase of 90 yuan,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
